<title>USA: Wall Street stocks mixed at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks mixed at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks were mixed at Monday's opening amid profit-taking. Markets focusing on earnings in the absence of economic data.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrial Average was up 1.61 at 6705.16</p>
</text>
